{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はもしフェスのはなしを！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日、日曜日に\n東京体育館で行われた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしフェスのZipperステージに\n出演させてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipperモデルとして\nランウェイのトリを歩かせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大先輩である\n瀬戸あゆみさんとトークも\nさせてもらいましたっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても優しくて\n話してる時もただ立ってる時も\n瀬戸あゆみさんの個性的な雰囲気が\n出ていてキラキラしてて\nかっこよかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipperモデルとして\n私はまだまだ力不足で\n何も貢献できていないのに\n本当にいろいろな事を\nいろいろな経験させてもらえてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても嬉しいし楽しくてしょうがないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、もっとがんばらなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服とかメイクとか\nもっとこだわりをもって研究して\nZipperモデルとして成長しなくちゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キラキラメイク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipperらしくて\nほんとにかわいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭についてるキラキラの紐は\nリボンではなく\n靴紐なんです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴紐を頭に巻いて\nリボン風にアレンジするなんて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個性的なかわいさが\nZipperらしくてすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからね！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとは雑誌では共演したことあったけど、\n初対面でとても緊張してて\nもじもじしてたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋に菅沼ゆりさんと柴田ひかりさんが\n来てくださりお話ししてもらえました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真も一緒に撮ってもらったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お二人が乃木坂のポーズあるー？\nって聞いてくださったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46ですの\"です\"」\nの部分を一緒にやってもらいました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菅沼ゆりさんは\nZipperの専属モデルになる前から\n可愛い！と思ってしってたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画像も保存したり。。。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな菅沼ゆりさんから\n直接頂いた\nゆりさんが自家出版した\nフォトブックを頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全ページ可愛かったけど\n特に好きなページと\nツーショット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柴田ひかりさんも元々知っていて\n転校先のクラスがたまたま同じだったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校の頃は一度も話せなかったけど\nZipperを通して\n知り合えてお話しできてお友達になれて\nとてもうれしい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のモデルさんとも\n写真を撮ってもらえました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、ちょっとずつ載せていくね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにうれしかったああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに一緒に写真を撮ってもらえて\n嬉しくてはしゃいでる図。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廊下の壁の隙間をみつけて\nはまったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/27/5723848/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！\nまたあした！"}],"source":"archive"}